🔹 Top 50 Behavioral Questions (PBCs, STAR-focused)
Problem Solving & Ownership

Tell me about a time you solved a technically challenging problem.

Describe a situation where you had to troubleshoot a production issue under pressure.

Tell me about a time you had to deliver a project with limited resources.

Describe a time you had to make a decision with incomplete data.

Tell me about a time you simplified a complex technical issue.

Leadership & Influence

Tell me about a time you influenced a decision without direct authority.

Describe a situation where you had to earn the trust of a teammate or stakeholder.

Give me an example of when you led a project outside your core responsibility.

Tell me about a time you convinced leadership to change direction.

Describe a time when you mentored or helped another teammate succeed.

Conflict & Teamwork

Tell me about a time you had a conflict with a teammate.

Describe a time when you disagreed with your manager.

Give an example of when you had to work with a difficult stakeholder.

Tell me about a time you had to build consensus among a diverse team.

Describe a situation where you had to push back against unrealistic expectations.

Delivery & Execution

Tell me about a time you delivered a project under tight deadlines.

Describe a time you went above and beyond to meet a commitment.

Give an example of a time you had to manage multiple priorities.

Tell me about a time you spotted a risk and mitigated it early.

Describe a time you had to balance speed vs. quality in delivery.

Innovation & Initiative

Tell me about a time you proposed a new idea that improved a project.

Describe a situation where you automated a manual process.

Tell me about a time you optimized a system or workflow.

Describe a time you took initiative without being asked.

Tell me about a time you challenged the status quo.

Failure & Learning

Tell me about a time you failed and what you learned.

Describe a situation where a project didn’t go as planned.

Give me an example of a time you made a mistake and how you handled it.

Tell me about a time you missed a deadline.

Describe a time you underestimated a task and how you recovered.

Customer / User Focus

Tell me about a time you built something with the customer in mind.

Describe a time you solved a problem for a customer/stakeholder.

Give me an example of when you handled customer feedback.

Tell me about a time you prioritized user experience over technical ease.

Describe a time you anticipated customer needs before they asked.

Ambiguity & Adaptability

Tell me about a time you worked with incomplete requirements.

Describe a situation where you had to adapt to changing priorities.

Give an example of when you handled ambiguity on a project.

Tell me about a time you quickly learned a new technology.

Describe a time you adapted your communication style to the audience.

Collaboration & Communication

Tell me about a time you improved collaboration in your team.

Describe a time you had to explain a complex technical topic to non-technical stakeholders.

Give me an example of a time you documented or improved knowledge sharing.

Tell me about a time you managed expectations with stakeholders.

Describe a time you worked on a cross-team or cross-functional project.

Leadership Principles & Values (Amazon/Google/MS/ Uber style)

Tell me about a time you demonstrated ownership end-to-end.

Give me an example of when you were data-driven in decision making.

Tell me about a time you balanced short-term results with long-term vision.

Describe a time you showed persistence in solving a tough problem.

Tell me about a time you raised the bar for yourself or your team.

✅ These 50 cover the most asked behavioral themes: problem solving, ownership, leadership, teamwork, delivery, failure, customer focus, adaptability, and values.